}

### DELETE Delete connector
DELETE http://localhost:8083/connectors/content-admin

### PUT Validate Config
PUT http://localhost:8083/connector-plugins/MySqlConnector/config/validate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "content-admin",
  "connector.class": "io.debezium.connector.mysql.MySqlConnector",
  "tasks.max": "1",
  "database.hostname": "devflix.content.admin.db",
